     A** WORK FILE - DEPOSIT RECAP REPORT IN AGENT ORDER
     A**
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDP01                     TEXT('DEPOSIT RECAP - AGENT ORDER')
     A            DPCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            DPFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            DPAGT#    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('AGENT #' 'ASSIGNED BY FUND')
     A            DPPROD    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROD#')
     A            DPEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            DPDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            DPSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            DPUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            DPPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            DPTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            DPDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
